### CT-200 Medical Manual QA API - REST Client / HTTP Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Ingest CT-200 Manual v1 (Local convenience endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/local?path=data/ct200_manual.pdf
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. List Documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### 4. List Top-Level Sections (Level 1)
# Replace {{doc_id}} with the returned document ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{doc_id}}/sections

### 5. Get Document Tree (Hierarchy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{doc_id}}/tree?include_text=false

### 6. Search for Normalized Text (Search 'profile' or 'cuff')
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=profile&scope=body

### 7. Create Version-Pinned Selection
# Pins sections 3.2 and 4.2 to Version 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/selections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuff and Safety Verification",
  "items": [
    {"node_id": "{{node_3_2_id}}", "version": 1},
    {"node_id": "{{node_4_2_id}}", "version": 1}
  ]
}

### 8. View Reconstructed Text for Selection (Prompt Input)
GET {{baseUrl}}/selections/{{selection_id}}/text

### 9. Generate QA Test Cases (LLM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/selections/{{selection_id}}/generate?force=false

### 10. Re-ingest CT-200 Manual v2 (New Version)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/local?path=data/ct200_manual_v2.pdf&document_id={{doc_id}}

### 11. View Whole-Document Diff (v1 vs v2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{doc_id}}/changes?from_version=1&to_version=2

### 12. Check Specific Node Changes with Significance
GET {{baseUrl}}/nodes/{{node_4_2_id}}/changes?from_version=1&to_version=2

### 13. Dynamic Staleness Retrieval (against latest version 2)
# Notice status changes to 'likely_stale' because E3 auto-deflate changed from 2s to 1.5s
GET {{baseUrl}}/selections/{{selection_id}}/test-cases?against_version=2

### 14. Query All Test Cases referencing a specific Node
GET {{baseUrl}}/nodes/{{node_4_2_id}}/test-cases?only_stale=false

### 15. View Document Impact Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{doc_id}}/impact?from_version=1&to_version=2
